166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 69 0 R
/T (The experiments show that machine-learning models can learn useful signals from job-posting text and structured attributes. Linear SVM was the strongest model in this comparison based on fraudulent-class F1-score and ROC-AUC. Logistic Regression \(SGD\) may be considered when higher fraud recall is preferred, while accepting a larger number of false alerts. The results demonstrate why accuracy alone is insufficient for an imbalanced fraud-detection task. )
/E (The experiments show that machine-learning models can learn useful signals from job-posting text and structured attributes. Linear SVM was the strongest model in this comparison based on fraudulent-class F1-score and ROC-AUC. Logistic Regression \(SGD\) may be considered when higher fraud recall is preferred, while accepting a larger number of false alerts. The results demonstrate why accuracy alone is insufficient for an imbalanced fraud-detection task. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [12]
>>
