413 0 obj
<<
/Title (The experiments show that machine-learning models can learn useful signals from job-posting text and structured attributes. Linear SVM was the strongest model in this comparison based on fraudulent-class F1-score and ROC-AUC. Logistic Regression \(SGD\) may be considered when higher fraud recall is preferred, while accepting a larger number of false alerts. The results demonstrate why accuracy alone is insufficient for an imbalanced fraud-detection task.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 411 0 R
>>
endobj
